<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-title">一键发布作品</view>
    <view class="hero-sub">仅供管理员使用；非管理员点击会返回 403</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="row">
      <view class="row-label">当前用户 OPENID</view>
      <view class="row-value mono">{{openid || '获取中…'}}</view>
      <button class="copy-btn" bindtap="copyOpenid" disabled="{{!openid}}">复制</button>
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <view class="row-label">待发布作品数</view>
      <view class="row-value">{{worksCount}} 篇</view>
    </view>
    <view class="hint">发到云端 <text class="mono">content</text> 集合，文档 <text class="mono">_id = work__{{'<id>'}}</text>，数据走 <text class="mono">works-bundled.js</text> 内嵌副本。</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 题壁选录：把学生通过「意见反馈」写来的话选录到题壁页 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="sec-title">题壁选录</view>
    <view class="sec-sub">学生在题壁页「落笔」后，内容会进 mp 后台「管理 → 用户反馈」；在此选录后即公开展示。</view>

    <textarea class="board-input" value="{{boardText}}" bindinput="onBoardInput"
      maxlength="300" placeholder="粘贴或写下留言内容" auto-height />
    <view class="board-count">{{boardText.length}}/300</view>

    <view class="row">
      <view class="row-label">日期</view>
      <picker mode="date" value="{{boardDate}}" bindchange="onBoardDate">
        <view class="row-value">{{boardDate}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>

    <view class="row">
      <view class="row-label">署名方式</view>
      <radio-group class="radio-group" bindchange="onBoardAnon">
        <label class="radio"><radio value="1" checked="{{boardAnonymous}}" />匿名（显示「佚名」）</label>
        <label class="radio"><radio value="0" checked="{{!boardAnonymous}}" />署名（显示词牌雅号）</label>
      </radio-group>
    </view>

    <view class="row" wx:if="{{!boardAnonymous}}">
      <view class="row-label">词牌雅号</view>
      <input class="board-input-line" value="{{boardPenName}}" bindinput="onBoardPen"
        placeholder="留空则自动分配" maxlength="12" />
    </view>

    <button class="primary" bindtap="publishBoard" disabled="{{boardPublishing}}">
      {{boardPublishing ? '题写中…' : '题上此壁'}}
    </button>

    <view class="board-list" wx:if="{{boardList.length}}">
      <view class="board-list-title">已题 {{boardList.length}} 则</view>
      <view class="board-item" wx:for="{{boardList}}" wx:key="id">
        <view class="board-item-head">
          <text class="board-item-name">{{item.anonymous ? '佚名' : (item.penName || '自动')}}</text>
          <text class="board-item-date">{{item.date}}</text>
          <text class="board-item-del" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="removeBoardItem">撤下</text>
        </view>
        <view class="board-item-text">{{item.content}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="hint">留言写入 <text class="mono">content</text> 集合 <text class="mono">_id = board</text>。学生端打开题壁页或下拉刷新即可看到，无需重新提审。</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 建议收件箱：学生通过自建「建议窗口」直接提交的内容 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="sec-title">建议收件箱</view>
    <view class="sec-sub">学生端「落笔」现直存云端 suggestions 集合；在此可读取、选录到题壁或删除。</view>

    <view class="board-list" wx:if="{{suggestions.length}}">
      <view class="board-list-title">未处理 {{suggestions.length}} 则</view>
      <view class="board-item" wx:for="{{suggestions}}" wx:key="_id">
        <view class="board-item-head">
          <text class="board-item-name">{{item.nameText}}</text>
          <text class="board-item-date">{{item.dateText}}</text>
          <text class="board-item-promote" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="promoteSuggestion">题上此壁</text>
          <text class="board-item-del" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="removeSuggestion">删除</text>
        </view>
        <view class="board-item-text">{{item.content}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="hint hint-err" wx:elif="{{suggestError}}">{{suggestError}}</view>
    <view class="hint" wx:else>暂无新建议。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <button class="primary" bindtap="startPublish" disabled="{{publishing}}">
      {{publishing ? '发布中…' : '一键发布全部作品到云端'}}
    </button>

    <view class="progress" wx:if="{{progressTotal > 0}}">
      <progress percent="{{progressCur / progressTotal * 100}}" stroke-width="6" activeColor="#8C2A2A" backgroundColor="#EFE7D6" />
      <view class="progress-text">{{progressText}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="result" wx:if="{{finished}}">
      <view class="result-line ok">✓ 成功 {{successCount}} 篇</view>
      <view class="result-line fail" wx:if="{{failedCount > 0}}">✗ 失败 {{failedCount}} 篇</view>
      <view class="result-sample" wx:if="{{failedSample.length > 0}}">
        <view class="sample-title">失败样例：</view>
        <view class="sample-item" wx:for="{{failedSample}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="result-debug" wx:if="{{debugInfo}}">
        <view class="debug-title">🔍 调试信息（直接对比下面两行）</view>
        <view class="debug-line">
          <text class="debug-label">云函数看到的你：</text>
          <text user-select="true" class="mono debug-value">{{debugInfo.yourOpenid}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="debug-line">
          <text class="debug-label">环境变量白名单：</text>
          <text user-select="true" class="mono debug-value">{{debugInfo.configuredAdmins.length ? debugInfo.configuredAdmins.join(' / ') : '(空)'}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="debug-hint">{{debugInfo.hint}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip">
    <view>说明：</view>
    <view>1. 本页只遍历本地内嵌的 <text class="mono">works-bundled.js</text>（46 篇），调 saveContent 云函数并发批量发到云数据库 content 集合。</view>
    <view>2. 云端存在同名 _id 文档会被覆盖；不会影响其他类型（course / cipai / ci-detail 等）。</view>
    <view>3. 失败 403 几乎都是因为你的 OPENID 不在 saveContent 的 ADMIN_OPENIDS 环境变量中——把上方 OPENID 复制给负责人即可。</view>
  </view>
</view>